y muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224030/extras/055c35ac85e8b3c7d73b9606556b34d5.poster.avif?t=1724711392\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224030/extras/055c35ac85e8b3c7d73b9606556b34d5.webm?t=1724711392\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2224030/extras/055c35ac85e8b3c7d73b9606556b34d5.mp4?t=1724711392\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Experience the relaxing feeling of spending time alone in nature. Enjoy the soothing ambiance of the cascading waterfall, capture the magnificent hues of the sunset through your lens, and marvel at the twinkling stars that light up the night sky.",
